docs/book               = clickable object in threejs
dock/book/category      = tabs on the overlay when you click on the book
dock/book/category/file = entry in each tab (html) TODO: markdown

File Naming Convention := code_TITLE.html 

e.g Category === CHARACTER

    Written First:  0_JimmyDescription.html
    Written Second: 1_JimmyArt.html
    Written Later:  01_JimmyDescriptionAddon.html

    --> Table of Contents built as:
    "CHARACTER": [0_JimmyDescription.html, 01_JimmyDescriptionAddon.html, 1_JimmyArt.html]

    --> Javascript processes as
    <div>
        1_JimmyArt.html                 <-- top (recent)
        01_JimmyDescriptionAddon.html
        0_JimmyDescription.html         <-- bottom (old)
    </div>

i.e lower code == bottom of screen

** DO NOT FORGET TO RUN `_build_index.sh` AFTER EACH CHANGE OR NOTHING WILL SHOW UP